  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\n25 + [20 - {2(20 × 1over5 ÷ 1over8 × 1over16 - 8)}]\n\n⇒ 25 + [20 - {2(20 × 1over5 × 8 × 1over16 - 8)}]\n\n⇒ 25 + [20 - {2(2 - 8)}]\n\n⇒ 25 + [20 - {2(-6)}]\n\n⇒ 25 + [20 - {-12}]\n\n⇒ 25 + [20 + 12]\n\n⇒ 25 + 32 = 57\n\n**Hence, the correct answer is option (3).**",
